          "literatureReview": "Thyroid Function Test (TFT) panel includes TSH, Free T4, and Free T3 for comprehensive thyroid evaluation. TSH is the primary screening test. If abnormal, Free T4 helps distinguish primary from secondary thyroid disease. Free T3 is useful in specific cases like T3 toxicosis. Chemiluminescent immunoassay provides accurate, automated measurement. Used in diagnosis of hypothyroidism/hyperthyroidism, monitoring thyroid hormone therapy, and evaluating thyroid nodules. Results interpreted together provide complete picture of thyroid status. Essential for managing thyroid disorders and adjusting medication dosages."
